      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-03-02_WidnesExaminer_art0083" n="art0083">
        <head>FA NO ARTICLES, SILVER AND ELECTILO-PLATE. ART EMBROIDERIES,</head>
        <p>FA NO ARTICLES, SILVER AND ELECTILO-PLATE. ART EMBROIDERIES,</p>
