        <p>BB WISE IN :Min Sufferers from Gr tvel, Lumbago. Piles, Pains in the Back, Dropsy, Wind and Water Complaint. Diseases of Kidneys, Bladder Stone. Sciatica, Rheumatism anal Gout will find a positive Cure in Holroyd's Gravel Pills. Try a small box and If not satisfied your money will be returned. Price is. of all Chemists. or post free for 12 stamps, from HOLROYD'S Medical Hall, Cheekheaten, Yorks. Don't be put off. If you cannot get them write to the Proprietor and a box will be at *ext.</p>
